Package: BurdenMLEDN
Type: Package
Title: Maximum-Likelihood Models for De Novo Variant Burden
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Ajay",
    family = "Nadig",
    email = "anadig@broadinstitute.org",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
  )
Description: Fits discrete-mixture maximum-likelihood models to gene-level
    de novo variant counts. The fitted distribution of gene-level rate ratios
    supports estimation of mutational variance, effective penetrance, and
    related burden summaries.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/ajaynadig/BurdenMLE-DN
BugReports: https://github.com/ajaynadig/BurdenMLE-DN/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    mixsqp,
    pbapply,
    stats,
    utils
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
